  "title": "小林漫画：婚姻的尽头是搞钱",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "01\n他忘了结婚纪念日\n你刚要发火\n他转了你五千块\n你说\n“算了，有心就好”\n他问\n“那明年还转吗”\n你说“转”\n他记下了\n你也不气了",
      "sourceIndex": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/UVsZ2xn51XJPaANrrpvwNSEl5hw6DX3t2XzPlYskuicZ9ZnRyauJbL9L9nLkpCGeOIj1No0xCVzHRncy4icZXkxESSBBSDvFrZJcYMp7g3qN8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg",
      "alt": "",
      "sourceIndex": 1,
      "localPath": "source-images/image-001.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "02\n你们商量要不要生二胎\n吵了一周\n最后算账\n换大房子多花一百万\n奶粉尿布每月三千\n学区房再加五十万\n算完两人沉默\n他说“一个也挺好”\n你说“对”",
      "sourceIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/UVsZ2xn51XKLqUibfsGVj6NibwIINxmO0y7iaib9dhHibIMpcVkglTIgQ3ku1RlFwbkibu7FlRBxtAvYadvBYia8M0IauuiaBDddic0YD6OmWp7Mw9iaI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg",
      "alt": "",
      "sourceIndex": 3,
      "localPath": "source-images/image-002.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "03\n婚姻到最后\n风花雪月都变成了柴米油盐\n我爱你变成了我赚够了吗\n你不浪漫没关系\n你会赚钱就行\n我不温柔没关系\n我会管钱就行\n两个人把日子过成一家合伙公司\n利润不高\n但没倒闭\n就是胜利",
      "sourceIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/UVsZ2xn51XIKVjaxYWy1buWt1BGjWicqu4HdjicfvMboFicHsSoWTfqhlc9HNsicuvtRWmVxOliaiaDvOKSJ2noZvqSAMlVtREf5ZO0kdWOAawNw4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg",
